/*!
\page page_strpscluster StRpsCluster

\brief Reconstructed hit cluster in a Roman Pot silicon strip detector plane.

\section rpscluster_overview Overview

StRpsCluster is a single reconstructed hit cluster in one silicon strip detector plane
of the **Roman Pot System (RPS)**.  A cluster is formed from one or more adjacent strips
with charge above threshold.  It records position along the strip axis, RMS spread,
strip count, deposited energy (ADC counts), transverse coordinate, and a quality flag.

**Detector**: Roman Pot System (RPS / pp2pp)  
**Stage**: silicon ADC → cluster finding → position reconstruction

\section rpscluster_hierarchy Class Hierarchy

\code
TObject → StObject → StRpsCluster
\endcode

StRpsCluster objects are stored in StRpsPlane and belong to the hierarchy:

\code
StRpsCollection → StRpsRomanPot[0..7] → StRpsPlane[0..3] → StRpsCluster
\endcode

The parent plane sets \c mPlaneId and \c mRomanPotId automatically via
\c StRpsPlane::addCluster().

\section rpscluster_members Data Members

| Type | Member | Description |
|------|--------|-------------|
| \c Double_t | \c mPosition | Hit position along the strip-sensitive axis (cm) |
| \c Double_t | \c mPositionRMS | RMS spread of the cluster position (cm) |
| \c Short_t | \c mLength | Number of strips in the cluster |
| \c Double_t | \c mEnergy | Total deposited charge (ADC counts) |
| \c Double_t | \c mXY | Coordinate perpendicular to the strip direction (cm) |
| \c UChar_t | \c mQuality | Cluster quality flag (0 = good) |
| \c UChar_t | \c mPlaneId | Parent plane index (0–3) within the Roman Pot |
| \c UChar_t | \c mRomanPotId | Parent Roman Pot index (0–7) |

\section rpscluster_methods Key Methods

| Method | Description |
|--------|-------------|
| \c position() | Hit position along strip direction (cm) |
| \c positionRMS() | RMS spread of position (cm) |
| \c length() | Number of strips |
| \c energy() | Total ADC charge |
| \c xy() | Transverse coordinate (cm) |
| \c quality() | Quality flag |
| \c planeId() | Parent plane index |
| \c romanPotId() | Parent Roman Pot index |

\section rpscluster_example Usage Example

\code{.cpp}
const StRpsPlane* plane = rp->plane(ip);
for (unsigned int ic = 0; ic < plane->numberOfClusters(); ++ic) {
    const StRpsCluster* cl = plane->cluster(ic);
    double pos  = cl->position();    // strip-axis hit (cm)
    short  nStr = cl->length();      // strip count
    double e    = cl->energy();      // ADC sum
}
\endcode

\see StRpsPlane, StRpsRomanPot, StRpsCollection
*/
